Package: tinyknit
Title: Create Lightweight HTML Outputs from R Markdown
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Brian", "Quinn", , "brian.quinn@nisra.gov.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to render R Markdown documents into reduced-size 
    HTML outputs by disabling self-contained mode, linking to shared external 
    resources where available, and embedding remaining local dependencies as 
    base64-encoded data URIs. Designed to support lightweight, shareable reports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports: 
    rmarkdown,
    xfun,
    httr,
    base64enc,
    utils,
    rstudioapi
